  "description": "From first tricks to full sends, the Nishiki Bonzai BMX is a purpose-built freestyle bike designed for progression. Starting with a tough, Hi-Ten steel frame with responsive geometry and an ultra-beefy fork, Nishiki takes the radness even further with high-quality, extra-tough components. Featuring a MicroDrive drivetrain, 3-piece cranks, 20\" wheels, plush 2.125\" tires, U-brake and included axle pegs, this burly bike is built for young riders looking to tame the toughest terrain.\n\nFEATURES:\n\nStunt-ready BMX/Freestyle bike built to shred parks, streets and urban jungles\n\nHigh-tensile steel frame with an extra-beefy fork delivers burly durability\n\nCustom shaped BMX Freestyle HiTen frame with beefy fork\n\nResponsive freestyle geometry for quick handling and confident control\n\n25/9 MicroDrive drivetrain adds clearance and sheds weight\n\nSamox 3-piece chromoly crankset handles hard riding and harder impacts\n\nHeavy-duty 20\" wheels wrapped in grippy 2.125\" all-surface tires\n\nPowerful U-brake stops on a dime — and gives nine cents change\n\nAxle pegs included for smooth trick progression right ou a’ the box",
